# Notifications module — demo requests (VS / Rider / VS Code REST Client).
#
# Setup: run the host (http://localhost:5080) and get a signed-in token:
#   - a student / professor token from http/users.http (steps 1, 6, 12–13), or
#   - the seeded admin token (admins have notifications too).
# Rows appear when a producer publishes Notifications.Contracts.NotificationRequested — P2's integration
# tests publish it through the test factory; later phases add the real producers (schedule, grades, …).

@host = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-a-signed-in-token-here
@notificationId = paste-a-notification-id-here

### 1. My notifications — newest first, paged (default page size 20, max 100)
GET {{host}}/api/notifications/mine?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Only the unread ones
GET {{host}}/api/notifications/mine?unreadOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Unread badge — { "count": n }
GET {{host}}/api/notifications/mine/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Mark one read (204; someone else's id or unknown → 404; marking twice keeps the first readAt)
POST {{host}}/api/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Mark all of mine read (204, also when nothing is left)
POST {{host}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
